WEBVTT

NOTE
English subtitles for the original Reefer Madness trailer, transcribed from its soundtrack
and timed to the trimmed copy in this folder (trailer.mp4).

00:00.800 --> 00:05.300
These high school boys and girls are
having a hop at the local soda fountain.

00:05.900 --> 00:07.500
Innocently they dance.

00:08.200 --> 00:12.700
Innocent of a new and deadly menace
lurking behind closed doors.

00:13.900 --> 00:18.200
Marijuana, the burning weed
with its roots in hell.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
In this film you will see the ease with which
this vicious plant can be grown in your neighbour's yard,

00:26.000 --> 00:32.300
rolled into harmless-looking cigarettes,
hidden in an innocent shoe or watch case.

00:33.400 --> 00:37.900
In this startling film you will see
dopesters lure children to destruction.

00:38.400 --> 00:41.900
– We're going over to Joe's place, why don't you come along?
– We have a date to play a set of doubles.

00:42.300 --> 00:44.200
Oh, you can play any time.
Come on, we'll have some laughs.

00:44.400 --> 00:45.800
– Can I go along with you?
– Sure.

00:46.000 --> 00:47.500
Hey, I'll see you at dinner, sis.

00:48.400 --> 00:50.500
If you want a good smoke,
try one of these.

00:50.500 --> 00:55.200
You will meet Bill, who once took pride
in his strong will,

00:55.200 --> 00:58.900
as he takes the first step
toward enslavement.

00:58.900 --> 01:01.400
Of course, if you're afraid…

01:05.500 --> 01:12.100
Smoking the soul-destroying reefer, they find
a moment's pleasure, but at a terrible price.

01:12.900 --> 01:13.900
Debauchery…

01:14.000 --> 01:15.300
violence…

01:15.400 --> 01:17.800
murder…

01:17.900 --> 01:22.000
suicide…

01:24.100 --> 01:30.700
and the ultimate end
of the marijuana addict:

01:32.000 --> 01:34.300
hopeless insanity.

01:42.200 --> 01:49.500
See this important film now,
before it is too late.
